# Copy to .env and fill in only what you need.
# Nothing in this repo requires an API key to run. The keys below are for the
# optional market-data adapter and the optional LLM-backed Judge.

# --- Market data (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# yfinance needs no key. Set this only if you use a proxy or a slower mirror.
# HTTPS_PROXY=

# --- Execution (optional, paper only by default) ---------------------------
# This repository ships ONE execution adapter and it is a simulator: it
# never sends an order anywhere. It refuses to act on an unsigned intent,
# and if `live` is ever enabled it refuses unless LIVE=1 is set in the
# environment. There is no broker adapter here, so there are no broker
# credentials to configure.
#
# To write your own adapter, implement the same interface and refuse
# unsigned intents the same way. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# LIVE=0

# --- Judge seat (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# The Judge seat has a deterministic default that needs no key. If you plug in
# an LLM, put the key here and pick the provider in config.yaml.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# KIMI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
